Yes, sports fans, my valkyrie traversed three whole dungeon levels (took
a lot of time) while being fainted - a pretty mean feat. And then proceeded
to drop dead at a shop when I'd found a shield of reflection and a 
tinning kit at the same shop (tombstone read: dead by starvation). The
circumstances of her hunger were quite curious - while fainting/eating
last ration the character was robbed blind by a nymph. The status line
never changed afterwards and since the character didn't faint anymore I 
thought I'd struck a lucky bug. 

The next character fared much better - but succumbed to multiple ogres
carrying wands of sleep. This item must be the only surefire killer
in the game - sleep resistance isn't that easy to gain, and the wand
works differently on monsters than PCs (or they are very very light 
sleepers). *Sigh*

